+section('updates py-3', 'insight-community')
    .row
        .col
            +title('mb-4','Community Focus')
            p.fs-20.fw-medium.text-secondary.mb-4 Qatar Deepens Global Economic and Strategic Ties
            p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary.mb-4 Resona8 Media is an established creative media company licensed under both QFC and Media City in Qatar, with a strong international footprint spanning Canada, Turkey, the UAE, and Qatar.
            p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary.mb-4 Specialising in broadcast graphics, real-time data aggregation, and full-spectrum channel branding, Resona8 offers end-to-end solutions that elevate media production beyond conventional limits.
            p.fs-20.fw-normal.text-secondary.mb-4 “We had the company up and running and operational in less than four weeks. We understand the legal, financial, and organisational aspects of forming a company, and QFC offered all of this with clarity and speed,” comments Ali Husseini, Managing Partner & CTO, Resona8 Media, on setting up with the QFC.
            a.fs-20.text-violet.fw-normal(href="#") Click here to learn more about Resona8 Media and its operations in Qatar.

